    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, respawn, and use your corpse as platforms and weights to solve puzzles. The idea is simple, but the <i>execution</i> may be difficult.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clever Deaths:</strong> Find creative ways to sacrifice yourself to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Sokoban:</strong>\u00a0Jump, climb, and drag boxes and corpses around to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Focused:</strong> Challenging puzzles without demanding platforming skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Freedom:</strong> 50+ carefully designed levels. Progress at your own pace by choosing from multiple available levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, respawn, and use your corpse as platforms and weights to solve puzzles. The idea is simple, but the <i>execution</i> may be difficult.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clever Deaths:</strong> Find creative ways to sacrifice yourself to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Sokoban:</strong>\u00a0Jump, climb, and drag boxes and corpses around to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Focused:</strong> Challenging puzzles without demanding platforming skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Freedom:</strong> 50+ carefully designed levels. Progress at your own pace by choosing from multiple available levels.</p></li></ul>",
